      trivia: "【El Martillito】The hammer that produced the USD 600 founding capital is called “El Martillito” (the little hammer), and is said to be carefully preserved by the family as a relic symbolising the brand's origins.\n【Pioneer of the Double Band】The serial-numbered double band introduced in 2001 allows authenticity to be confirmed by referring the number to the company, and is regarded as a pioneering anti-counterfeiting measure in luxury cigars. So thorough was it that any Anniversary lacking the second band is deemed pre-February 2001 stock or a fake.\n【A Record Tally of Crowns】Five Cigar of the Year awards in all (2004, 2007, 2009, 2021 and 2025) are reputedly the most of any single brand, and that scarcely a year has passed outside the upper ranks since the Top 25 began likewise attests to the stability of the house's reputation."
